VICE-129: librw scene-graph sync. Recompute a frame's LTM only when its inputs
changed: Matrix gets a CHANGED flag set by every value writer, syncRecurse uses
it (and the parent's LTM change) instead of recomputing the whole subtree, and
syncDirty tests the hierarchy root with ltm == matrix.

Apply from the root of the librw checkout:
    git apply patches/librw-scene-sync.patch      (or: patch -p1 < ...)
The CMake build applies it automatically before configuring librw.
See docs/adr/0014-librw-scene-sync-patch.md.

